[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked known: one issue, one fix queued. Its reports held three
problems. Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October with the parser fix. That settles two of the three;
the third is still open.

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
